  "text": "### 3.1 Authority  \n**Unrestricted Access:**\n- Full access to all records, systems, and premises\n- Authority to interview any employee or contractor\n- Right to access Board Audit Committee directly (no management filter)\n- Ability to observe any business activity or process\n- Authority to hire external specialists (with approval)  \n**No Authority to:**\n- Manage business operations\n- Make business decisions\n- Implement controls (advise, not execute)\n- Override management decisions\n- Direct departmental activities",
